{"ref":"BDB, זוֹב","hw":"זוֹב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹב</span></big>  <strong>n.m. issue (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَوْبٌ</span> <em>fluid, liquid;</em> NH <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹב</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹבָא</span> in specif. sense of Heb.<strong>)</strong>;—<em>issue, flux</em>, always from genitals (cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.2\">Lv 15:2</a>); only P: of man or woman <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">Lv 15:33</a>;—of man <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.2\">Lv 15:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.3\">3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.15\">15</a>; of woman <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.19\">Lv 15:19</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּם יִהְיֶה זֹבָהּ בִּבְשָׂרָהּ</span>, of monthly period); also v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.30\">30</a> (of morbid issue of blood, sometimes connected with the other; cf. Mat 9:20 etc.)","next":"BDB, זוג²","prev":"BDB, זוּב"}